WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:37.170
Moon Moon demonstrated that...

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:40.670
an ancient lifestyle is
possible even in space.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:44.640
It was an important lesson.
Yeah, that's what I think.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:47.950
But thanks to that,
the Argama's supplies were so exhausted...

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:51.690
the ship had to link back up
with the La Vie en Rose.

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:56.060
I understand how they feel,
but I'm running out of patience!

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:02.650
MELEE ABOARD THE ARGAMA

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.140
What are the enemy
ship's movements?

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:18.930
They still haven't noticed us.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:22.050
Meaning this could be
our chance to attack.

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.680
But I can't figure out
what they're planning to do.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:26.450
Where are they headed?

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:28.550
Axis, of course.

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:29.010
What?

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:33.590
They just lost a ship, so now they'll
run home and resupply, right?

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.660
I see. You have a point.

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:39.570
Anyone would think that,
considering the situation.

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:41.480
Captain, are you tired?

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.770
This is why I hate
dealing with old guys.

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:49.210
Old guys...

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.440
Captain, where are you going?

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:52.450
My quarters!

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.940
It's tough being married
with children, huh?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.900
So insensitive...

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.050
Huh?! The enemy's gone!

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:01.350
Did they deploy more dummies?

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:08.260
Mirai...

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.060
Who's there?

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.260
lt's Emary.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.370
You're changing?!
I'm so sorry!

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:18.370
It's fine. What's up?

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:22.610
The refitting of the Argama
will be complete in about five hours.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:27.020
You've done a fine job in
such a short time. I appreciate it.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:32.220
Here, the results of the refitting.
You now have high mega particle cannons.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:38.080
Their output is much higher.
They can destroy a warship with one shot.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.060
Anyway...

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:40.460
Emary...

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.960
Wh-What...?

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:46.270
It's just... well...
how do I put it?

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:50.400
Doing a refit like this
in such a short time...

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:54.410
It was my duty! My job...

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:57.240
B-But I...

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:59.380
I appreciate it.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.920
Is that all?

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.950
Captain Bright!

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:08.220
I... I...!

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.020
Emary, wait!

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:13.360
I'm the captain.
And as captain, I must always...

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:15.590
Don't say it!

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.670
Miss Emary...

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:31.440
It wasn't for very long, but I was
happy to have the Argama here.

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:33.560
Emary.

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.280
Goodbye!

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.250
Emary!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.560
Emary!

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:44.040
Everyone, listen to me!

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.490
Just listen as you work.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.010
What? Judau?

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.860
I've been thinking.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:54.170
To protect the way of life
of colonies like Moon Moon,

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:57.370
we have to come together
and fight as one!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:59.770
Since we haven't been
able to work as one,

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:03.840
Axis took advantage of it and
turned some of us into traitors.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.790
Did he say traitors?!

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:08.750
So come together,
crew of the Argama!

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.250
Judau's on fire today!

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.020
That's what a real man sounds like!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:12.720
Yeah!

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:13.550
There's a fire?

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:14.950
Mind your own business!

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:16.540
Do your work!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:20.560
If you abuse a prisoner, I can sue
you for violating the Antarctic Treaty!

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:23.950
Except it also says that
prisoners have to do work!

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:27.030
Which I'm doing!
Got a problem with that?!

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:28.550
Agh! You broke it!

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:32.470
It's so we never see traitors like
Beecha and Mondo ever again!

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:35.010
Who are you calling traitors?!

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:39.750
What's got you so worked up?!

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:43.450
Aren't you ashamed to call
your own friends traitors?!

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.050
I'm just saying the truth!

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:48.520
Mondo wouldn't have helped
us if he was a real traitor!

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:51.360
But they're not
here now, are they?!

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:53.010
Stop it, Elle!

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:56.360
Iino!
Doesn't it bother you?!

00:05:56.360 --> 00:06:00.670
We've striven together as friends,
and now Judau calls them traitors?!

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.470
I'm telling it like it is!

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:04.870
Isn't it Rasara who you really
want to be with?!

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:06.470
That's just your imagination!

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:08.470
Get it off the PA.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.940
It's just a lover's quarrel.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.730
Which is why
I want it off the PA!

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:12.450
Ouch!

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:13.650
They're your friends!

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.750
Elle, stop it!

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.990
Lemme go! You're holding
a torch for Beecha and Mondo.

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:18.850
NO, I'M NOT!

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:20.850
Elle!

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.590
Iino, let me go!

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:23.910
Calm down!

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:27.360
The Argama's nowhere
near military-trained.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:27.690
The Argama's nowhere
near military-trained.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.860
We're going to lose.

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:40.140
We never anticipated
the loss of the Endra.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:43.640
I must offer my sincerest
apologies to Lady Haman.

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:47.380
This isn't the time to
play my trump card.

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.050
Yes?

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:52.250
An unidentified launch
has come onto our course.

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:53.780
Have it seized and inspected.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:55.250
Sir!

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.520
It might be AEUG.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:03.760
Leina, you have to master Beyer
by the time this ship reaches Axis.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:07.290
That would be
expected of a proper lady.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:20.250
See?! That's why I said we should
have taken a detour!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.180
But they told us to get to the
Argama as soon as we could--

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:28.650
They're signaling us
to heave to! Now what?

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:29.860
Oh, no!

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:31.560
I'm not taking
responsibility for this!

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:34.660
Understood!
I'll assume responsibility!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:37.960
S-Stop!

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.130
But...!

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:45.200
Why, you... jerk me around
again and I'll destroy you!

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:53.050
They claim they're civilian vendors, but...
Gottn, question them.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:53.950
Me, sir?

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:55.980
Yes. It's a chance
to make up for...

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:58.080
your failure at
Moon Moon, isn't it?

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.190
I... I suppose so.

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:04.590
Outta my way!

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.660
We just folded those!

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:12.470
I hate this life!

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:13.370
Mondo!

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:14.070
Beecha!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:14.480
Hold me!

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:17.670
That pilot girl's really cute.

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:19.440
l saw them on the monitor.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:24.640
The man doesn't look likely to talk,
so focus on interrogating the girl.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:26.450
Do we torture her?

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:28.150
Play it by ear.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.450
I can't wait.

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:32.790
I don't know anything!

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:35.550
P-P-Please, don't hit me!

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:37.610
We were just on our
way to the Argama!

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:40.160
What, you talked already?

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.030
I don't know anything!

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:45.700
I'll tell you everything!
Just please don't hit me!

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:47.170
Supplies for the Argama?

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.570
Y-Yes! That's right!

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:49.570
Liar!

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:50.570
It's the truth!

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:53.170
Hold it. I don't think he's lying.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.870
N-No, sir! I'm not!

00:08:58.460 --> 00:09:01.250
What are these?
Mobile suit parts?

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:05.550
I didn't ask about the
details of what's inside, so...

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:06.650
Liar!

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:10.060
I swear!
I'm just a delivery man!

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.060
l don't know all the details
about the contents.

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:13.090
It's true!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:13.760
Liar!

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:16.510
Enough. Either way,
we can use this as a decoy.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:19.880
Then we of the Endra
corps will take off, sir!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.190
Endra corps?

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:24.870
We figured we'd keep
the Endra's name alive.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.060
We don't want to forget that ship!

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.340
You guys...

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.360
Well said!

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:35.310
If Master Mashymre
were here, he'd say this:

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:39.380
You are all true knights!
The three musketeers of the Endra!

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:42.390
That's right! I'm one
of those three musketeers!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.030
No, I'm the third one!

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:46.560
The Endra will never die!

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:48.460
Guys...

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.860
That's right!
Long live the Endra!

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:56.270
Long live the Endra!
Long live the Endra!

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:59.270
This is one nutty ship
we've been captured by.

00:09:59.270 --> 00:10:00.690
Apparently so.

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:03.040
Master Glemy, the launch has taken off.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.240
The Bawoo is also launching!

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:07.050
What? The Bawoo is
my mobile suit!

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:09.420
It's Gottn and the
surviving Endra crew.

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:37.140
Endra corps is now initiating an
operation to seize the Argama!

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:39.630
We need no assistance
from the Mindra!

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:45.750
Gottn, it's because you
only think of tactics like this...

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.950
that the Endra
got destroyed!

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:48.840
Don't you see that?!

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:54.190
I'm taking responsibility in my
own way! Just shut up and watch!

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:58.800
You damn fool!
You'll get no help from me!

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.170
An AEUG launch?

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:08.410
No question about it.
That's a coded signal flare.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:12.010
Something seems to be
hanging off of the launch.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:14.280
Looks like an
enemy mobile armor.

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:16.420
They say they found one
that had been abandoned.

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:18.880
Never seen that type before.

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:22.250
I'm Madchar Mucha,
from Granada.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:24.220
Requesting permission
to come aboard.

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:27.540
Understood, Mr. Madchar.
Please hold your position.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.050
Send Judau over
to them in the Zeta.

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:31.160
I was eating!

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:33.900
Seriously, this is no way
to treat your workers!

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:40.270
Don't tip them off! Follow the Argama's
instructions till we're aboard!

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:41.320
U-Understood

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.040
Then what about our duty?!

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:45.360
You think you're in any
position to say that?!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.050
Don't resist them, Milly.

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:49.550
Got it? I'll look for the Double Zeta.

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.920
Then I'll take the Zeta Gundam!

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:55.960
Hey! Keep still!

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:59.090
R-Right.
Milly, do what they say.

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:01.160
No!

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.140
What's...?!

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.850
What are you doing?!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:25.990
The launch just ran
into the catapult!

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:28.550
You just had to be a hero, huh?!

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.620
Let's go! Take the Argama!

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:31.820
Let's go!

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:34.330
Yeah! Take the Argama!

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.230
Axis soldiers!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:40.130
What?!

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:42.430
They've entered
the mobile suit deck!

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:45.540
Outta my way!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:49.540
Avoid using your guns!
Take the Argama unharmed!

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:54.450
It's no use shutting the hatches
once we've taken the mobile suits!

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:57.250
Where's the opening switch?!

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.860
Why, you!

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:01.740
Think it'll be that easy
to take the Mk. II?!

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:03.520
Are you the Argama's Newtype?

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:06.190
Uh-oh! He's got a gun!

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:13.130
Come out! I'll take the Zeta fair
and square, without using the gun!

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:16.940
Huh? Fair and square?
With what?

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.690
With these!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.870
A fist fight?
And he looks strong, too...

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:28.450
Axis soldiers?

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.850
They apparently stormed in via
that launch from Granada.

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.590
All hands, drop what you're doing!

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:37.660
The Argama's under enemy attack!
Give them assistance!

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:40.130
Why, you...! Don't run away!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.210
Running is a way
of fighting, too!

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.980
You've got too much
of a weight advantage!

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:46.970
I'm giving you a handicap!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:49.030
It's cowardly to use a weapon!

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:52.490
As opposed to just
suddenly busting in here?!

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:55.860
You...! Have you
no sense of chivalry?!

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:57.640
You call yourself a soldier?!

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:01.480
Too bad, pal! I'm not a soldier!

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:06.120
In that case, I'll beat
some chivalry into you!

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:14.990
It's too dangerous for guns!
Don't use them!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:18.010
It'll be fine if
I never miss the target.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.830
Gottn?

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:21.870
Take me to the bridge.

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:25.770
Captain Bright.

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:27.490
C'mon!

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:29.950
- What?!
- Emary!

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:31.340
Don't move!

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:32.400
Let me go!

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:34.740
Stop! I'll be your hostage!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:37.350
No way! She's better!

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:39.050
Gottn.

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:42.020
Okay? Any enemies come in here,
we'll jump on their heads!

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:42.920
Got it!

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.440
Good.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:48.960
Don't get any funny ideas,
Miss Chara! You can't escape!

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:53.250
Shut up! Like I'm going
to obey some little kid?!

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:55.770
- Oh, man!
- All of a sudden?!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:59.140
If I don't make a sudden move,
when should I?!

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:07.350
Come on, move!
What's the matter?!

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.690
Why, you!

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.750
Nel!

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:15.590
Uh-oh!
They're gonna get the Zeta!

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.060
Stop!

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:21.860
I said I'm not letting
you get away with this!

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:24.000
Thanks, Elle.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.620
Judau, behind you!

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:29.340
Outta my way!
The Zeta's mine!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:32.440
Man, they just don't give up!

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:35.370
Where's the hatch switch?

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.510
Why, you!
Get out, you thief!

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:39.250
Shut up!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.550
What's going on, Judau?

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:45.390
Judau, stop!
What are you doing?!

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:46.950
Outta my way!

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:49.250
There's no way I am!

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:53.760
Ow... Judau!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.760
Elle, don't let go of the Zeta!

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:00.430
And they can never take
either one this way!

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:05.940
We'll concentrate on
just getting that new suit.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.610
Eura! Look for the new one!

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:12.650
Below us!
There's something down there!

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:15.130
Give it a rest!

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:17.850
Not a step closer!
One wrong move, and I'll...

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:19.150
Gottn!

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.620
Mistress Chara!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.520
Stop!

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:25.520
Don't move!
You surprised me, ma'am!

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:29.730
Well, I couldn't just sit still
while this was going on.

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:32.520
The apron kinda suits you.

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:35.530
- You're sweet.
- It's hopeless! Give it up!

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:36.730
Quiet!

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:42.140
This man is important to me!
You won't lay a finger on him!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:45.710
Mistress Chara, you really
feel that way about me?

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:49.850
While I hold Gottn down,
 you guys save Miss Emary.

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:51.310
- Right!
- Gotcha!

00:16:51.310 --> 00:16:54.500
Even if you take the bridge,
you won't get the Argama!

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:59.590
You're not making sense with me!
Mistress Chara, this way.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.830
What's the problem?!
Why won't it move?

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:10.140
Of course! Maybe if
I blast this arm with missiles...

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:19.300
- Now!
- Run!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:20.650
Gottn!

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:21.480
Stop!

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.150
Gottn!

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:31.320
Gottn!

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:32.570
Emary!

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.230
AGH! HELP!

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:47.910
That was close.
That woman also...

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:53.180
Why won't it move?!

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:56.480
Mr. Gottn!

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:01.050
Here, hold on to her!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:02.120
Yes, sir!

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:05.290
This is how you
pilot a mobile suit!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:15.030
The enemy mobile
suit is on the move!

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:18.040
Somebody, launch a mobile suit!
Is anybody there?!

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.940
Where's the enemy mobile suit?!

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:32.150
We've failed.

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:35.490
Eura! We'll get out and
rendezvous with the Bawoo!

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.920
I'll smash the Argama's bridge!

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:40.530
We aren't capturing it?

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:41.890
We can fix it later!

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.130
Wh-What?

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:50.830
Mr. Gottn, it's the Double Zeta!

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:57.310
You don't get to have a party
like this without paying for it!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:04.880
You shouldn't make light
of the Bawoo's performance!

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:11.020
Trying to hide?!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:17.960
There!

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:22.110
Huh?

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:29.440
I'll dial down the power.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.480
Missed!

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:49.090
Missiles!

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:57.500
You're sliced!

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.740
Gotcha!

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:07.180
What's wrong?!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.750
Losing power!

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:10.250
Master Gottn!

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:11.720
Wait for us!

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:14.420
You won't escape!

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.260
Wh-What...?

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:21.690
Soldiers in normal suits...

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:23.430
What are you doing, Judau?

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:24.540
Shoot!

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:28.180
But... but I see people there!

00:20:28.180 --> 00:20:30.940
The woman!
We'll use her as a shield!

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:31.640
Huh?

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:33.140
Put her out in front
of the hatch!

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:33.910
Sir!

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.580
Hey!

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.010
Wait!

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:40.780
Wait a sec!

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:42.410
Out of my way!

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:45.850
What's wrong, Judau?
Can't you fire?

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:48.570
This is war!

00:20:53.340 --> 00:20:55.530
Huh? Isn't that Miss Emary?

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:56.530
What's wrong, Judau?!

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:59.570
Shut up! You want Miss Emary
to get caught in that?!

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:01.230
What?

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:04.000
Miss Emary just bailed out
of the enemy mobile suit!

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:04.380
Really?!

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:05.370
Really!

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:06.410
Hold fire!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:12.340
Why aren't you firing,
Double Zeta?!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:18.320
Emary!

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:24.020
That's...

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:25.520
Captain!

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:30.130
Emary!

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:36.500
Deputy Captain.
I'm glad you're safe.

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:43.540
Thanks for coming
personally, Captain.

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:47.480
It's all right.
Just part of my duty.

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:53.300
What are they doing?!
This is an emergency!

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:56.760
I'm taking you back,
Captain! Deputy Captain!

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:11.570
Gundams, eh?
They seem useful, right, Milly?

00:22:11.570 --> 00:22:13.940
Just as we expected them to be.

00:22:13.940 --> 00:22:15.840
Right, Captain Bright?

00:22:15.840 --> 00:22:19.450
Naturally.
Because we have excellent pilots.

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:20.550
Apparently.

00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:28.450
They're sending out more
new mobile suits after us.

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:33.890
Once we're resupplied,
I'm going to rescue Leina!

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:48.160 --> 00:23:52.570
While testing the Argama's new cannon,
we're attacked by a Ga-Zowmn!

00:23:52.730 --> 00:23:54.240
As if that isn't enough,

00:23:54.240 --> 00:23:58.450
Chara uses Shinta as a shield
and steals the Core Top!

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.780
I feel like we've got enemies
to the front and behind!

00:24:00.780 --> 00:24:02.790
While we're wondering if we can
dock to form the Double Zeta,

00:24:02.950 --> 00:24:04.790
<i>Another</i> enemy appears!

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:06.750
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Retrieve the Core Top!"

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:09.920
RETRIEVE THE CORE TOP!

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:09.920
Next Time

00:24:09.040 --> 00:24:11.970
This is really turning
into a robot anime!
